{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "885b01edfbfa",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-27T00:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/local-reachy-mini-conversation",
  "sourceTitle": "Reachy Mini goes fully local",
  "sourceBodyHash": "62cde8fbebd73a4777fdb126e480d1a7646805ae9720959c02f738f250afb27d",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:18:23.343694Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T03:59:57.929586Z",
  "totalBlocks": 95,
  "translatedBlocks": 88,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf1a714b89bb8c0b",
      "translationZh": "组装好 Reachy Mini 后，你就可以安装对话应用，开始与它交谈。在此之前，你必须将音频发送到服务器。但现在不必了。今天，我们将带你在本地运行整套技术栈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b75cc72f87c5d660",
      "translationZh": "这套技术栈由我们的 speech-to-speech 驱动，它是一条 VAD → STT → LLM → TTS 级联流水线，提供与 Realtime API 兼容的 /v1/realtime WebSocket 接口。启动后端后，在 UI 中将机器人连接到该后端即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb19ee142d0256c",
      "translationZh": "级联是当今开源领域最灵活的方案，搭配合适的组件，也能成为速度最快的方案。我们会推荐自己最喜欢的组件，但级联的核心意义就在于，你可以替换这些组件。每周都有新模型发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64459b6056cea83e",
      "translationZh": "要点速览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "698a37f271b8c257",
      "translationZh": "为你的 Reachy Mini 部署本地语音后端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd3eb28732cc5fbe",
      "translationZh": "我们使用自己的 speech-to-speech 库，采用级联方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "558841d964665f42",
      "translationZh": "推荐：llama.cpp 搭配 Gemma 4、Silero VAD、Parakeet-TDT 0.6B v3 STT、Qwen3-TTS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0eb95fb6244c03f1",
      "translationZh": "快速开始",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ede2179cdcf421d0",
      "translationZh": "这篇博客将带你在完全本地的环境下与 Reachy Mini 进行对话。无需云端，无需 API 密钥，数据也不会离开你的机器。下面是一段实时演示视频：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b2461c46db5236b",
      "translationZh": "在本地部署 LLM 服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad653067ab0f4be6",
      "translationZh": "我们将使用 Hugging Face 的 llama.cpp 来提供 LLM 服务。如果需要安装，最简单的方法是运行 brew install llama.cpp 或 winget install llama.cpp；如需更多帮助，请查阅文档。首先，我们将运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0e671d4ca39b0dd",
      "translationZh": "这样就完成了！首次运行时会下载模型，之后启动就很快了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96a04def39517413",
      "translationZh": "这些参数有什么作用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d2044665a36ff260",
      "translationZh": "-hf ggml-org/gemma-4-E4B-it-GGUF — 直接从 Hub 拉取模型。首次运行时下载，之后运行时使用缓存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c33d30a205f9e196",
      "translationZh": "-np 2 — 两个并行槽位。让服务器能够处理第二个请求（例如一次快速打断），而不必等待第一个请求完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "553a86769c0a65f0",
      "translationZh": "-c 65536 — 64k 上下文窗口，由各槽位共享。为长对话留出了充足的余量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb482b2517ce990c",
      "translationZh": "-fa on — 闪存注意力（flash attention）。速度更快，内存占用更低，在现代硬件上基本没有额外开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9b564aefaae7a6b",
      "translationZh": "--swa-full — 保留完整的滑动窗口注意力缓存，而不是重新计算它。多用一点 RAM，换来 Gemma 上明显更快的提示词处理速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0626f28dcc4a1404",
      "translationZh": "设置语音到语音功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8aaf106edb5a4ec2",
      "translationZh": "我们先简单地安装这个库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e02e980669db73a7",
      "translationZh": "然后，在另一个终端中运行 LLM 服务的同时，我们只需运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b65ee1b19bc158a8",
      "translationZh": "这样，你就可以通过终端开始与模型交谈了！首次运行时需要下载 Parakeet-TDT 0.6B v3 和 Qwen3TTS，但后续启动就很快了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0920a4e9bd278dc9",
      "translationZh": "下面这段视频展示了本地对话模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e31195a4082c90d",
      "translationZh": "现在，在用 --mode local 试用过之后，你可以去掉该选项，再次运行这条命令，为机器人提供语音到语音服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "52d9a2b1a9a497a3",
      "translationZh": "将 Reachy Mini 连接到 speech-to-speech",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24a496ded16b624a",
      "translationZh": "在 llama.cpp 和 speech-to-speech 都运行起来后，你就可以通过桌面应用启动机器人，并打开对话应用。在对话应用的界面中，你需要点击 HF 后端中的“edit connection”来选择本地模式。下面的视频演示了如何操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25f0bcaa7f5a262d",
      "translationZh": "这样就完成了。你可以开始和机器人交谈了。处理流水线的每个阶段都需要权衡：有些 TTS 模型速度更快，但质量较低；有些 STT 模型速度较慢，但质量更高。我们针对多语言进行了优化，而你可能希望针对单一语言进行优化。本文接下来的部分将介绍如何进行自定义。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ca09489767939e4",
      "translationZh": "深入探索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "029d1c4c0cdb1353",
      "translationZh": "为什么要运行自己的 Speech-to-Speech 服务器？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d29f75ea97e0a4c7",
      "translationZh": "托管式实时后端很方便，但运行自己的引擎能带来三点好处：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71ad6cf7ac2d8acb",
      "translationZh": "隐私。音频始终不会离开你的网络，整个处理流水线都在你掌控的硬件上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04618c553f903dc6",
      "translationZh": "无 API 费用。不按分钟或 token 收费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8b166db6314d684",
      "translationZh": "完全掌控整个流水线。VAD、STT、LLM、TTS，任何组件都能替换。只要 Hub 🤗 上出现更好的选择，就可以换上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af3b4e5b86ba0d22",
      "translationZh": "speech-to-speech 仓库通过一个 CLI 就能提供上述所有功能。它会在 /v1/realtime 启动一个 WebSocket 服务器，使用 Reachy Mini 已经支持的同一套通信协议。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ac615c6fcbdd40ef",
      "translationZh": "我们有明确取舍的默认配置：VAD、STT、TTS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c0ee65e6cd4980e",
      "translationZh": "级联语音流水线包含四个阶段：VAD、STT、LLM 和 TTS。我们为其中三个阶段选用了可靠的默认方案，让你可以专注于 LLM：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de838855e4a6e04e",
      "translationZh": "阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efa0389ac6fce142",
      "translationZh": "选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3ae14a50bfe463f",
      "translationZh": "原因",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a28ad805d9ce36cf",
      "translationZh": "语音活动检测（VAD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2201c246562fcb3",
      "translationZh": "体积小巧、准确，可在 CPU 上运行。是开源语音智能体领域事实上的默认选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c78e0e17576dce9",
      "translationZh": "语音转文本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b387cda90edc63f1",
      "translationZh": "对流式处理友好，速度极快，英语识别质量出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23de9b0a34210ace",
      "translationZh": "文本转语音",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ca3905c43dfa40b",
      "translationZh": "表现力丰富、低延迟、支持多语言和自定义音色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3220f0b873ebe855",
      "translationZh": "对于这些选择，我们有自己的偏好；如果你有其他偏好，尽管替换成自己的选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb1593ae12233b1b",
      "translationZh": "选择你的 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebf75cc4aa3e38bf",
      "translationZh": "LLM 是对系统延迟和整体性能影响最大的一层。我们支持两种选项：在本地运行模型（llama.cpp、MLX、Transformers、vLLM），或使用提供 Responses API 的服务器（OpenAI、Gemini、HF Inference Endpoints、llama.cpp、vLLM 等）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f613b8e9ff6635f9",
      "translationZh": "Responses API：将大脑与语音循环解耦",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06c05e07768cb044",
      "translationZh": "系统的主要瓶颈是 LLM 推理延迟。为解决这一问题，我们支持通过 Responses API 协议对外提供服务的外部推理引擎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de6dc2c35fbcaf71",
      "translationZh": "因此，语音到语音引擎支持第二种模式：只要 LLM 遵循 Responses API 协议，就可以在独立进程中运行。你在一个终端中启动模型服务器，在另一个终端中启动语音循环，两者通过 HTTP 通信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2c334fcae5fbf20d",
      "translationZh": "选项 1：在一个终端中运行 llama.cpp，在另一个终端中运行语音到语音引擎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "483ba3397a949fc2",
      "translationZh": "终端 1：llama.cpp 服务器：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a671cfa1c00fcf1",
      "translationZh": "终端 2：语音到语音客户端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b6c6643361a1fa30",
      "translationZh": "方案 2：在一个终端中运行 vLLM，在另一个终端中运行语音到语音服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11caa2632b4e68d4",
      "translationZh": "要求 vLLM ≥ 0.21.0。vLLM 0.21.0 开始全面支持 Responses API 协议，包括语音到语音后端所使用的工具调用流式传输。旧版本虽然能启动，但只要助手尝试调用工具就会出错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1889c0a9022350a2",
      "translationZh": "通过 vLLM 为这条流水线提供模型服务时，以下三个标志实际上是必需的：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e1837ddce8ffedd",
      "translationZh": "--tool-call-parser <tool_parser_name> — 选择对应模型家族的解析器，将模型的原始输出转换为结构化工具调用（例如，Qwen3 指令模型使用 qwen3_coder，Llama 3 使用 llama3_json，Hermes 风格的模型使用 hermes，等等）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e71bd7e0df605a02",
      "translationZh": "--default-chat-template-kwargs '{\"enable_thinking\":false}'：对于支持 <think> 推理通道的模型，禁用该通道。对于更困难的智能体任务，你可以将此值改为 true，让模型进行推理；但为了让对话感觉自然，我们强烈建议保持关闭：每一个思考 token 都会增加延迟，用户听到的就是机器人开口前的沉默。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfa3a0dfdcc4cec9",
      "translationZh": "终端 1：vLLM 推理服务器（Qwen/Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b017f9412975c02",
      "translationZh": "--speculative-config 这一行启用多令牌预测（MTP）。它是可选的，但对端到端延迟影响很大。只要模型支持，就保持启用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a671cfa1c00fcf1",
      "translationZh": "终端 2：语音到语音客户端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "059439f778ec0580",
      "translationZh": "选项 3：Hugging Face Inference Endpoints",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a5a3b5c1aa2cfa6",
      "translationZh": "协议相同，但模型运行在 Hugging Face 的托管 GPU 上。将任意聊天模型部署为 Inference Endpoint，然后将语音循环指向该端点 URL：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ebe6f2de487ac58",
      "translationZh": "选项 4：Hugging Face Inference Providers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fa555254640dabe",
      "translationZh": "如果你不想管理自己的端点，可以使用 Inference Provider。Hugging Face 通过单个 URL 将你的请求路由到第三方后端（例如 Together、Fireworks、Replicate）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a85a4578d3f083bc",
      "translationZh": "选项 5：OpenAI（或任何兼容 OpenAI 的服务提供商）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "059385272f703051",
      "translationZh": "当你想在无需任何基础设施的情况下使用前沿模型进行测试时，将同一个标志指向 OpenAI：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e87e958a80c382d9",
      "translationZh": "--responses_api_* 这些标志对任何实现了该协议的提供商（OpenRouter、Together、Fireworks 等）都同样适用。替换基础 URL 和 API 密钥，其余流水线保持不变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2039a637e86a5fb2",
      "translationZh": "在进程内运行 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "18570a9abb8085b8",
      "translationZh": "方案 1：基于 MLX 的本地 LLM（Apple Silicon）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e5c3731b19974ec",
      "translationZh": "如果你使用 Mac，MLX 是以合理延迟运行一个真正模型的最省事方式。我们推荐 Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507，它足够小，在 M 系列芯片上运行时能让人感觉响应即时，同时能力也足以支撑对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "160e40d0c9bc6d70",
      "translationZh": "服务器默认监听 ws://127.0.0.1:8765/v1/realtime。让它保持运行，将对话应用连接到本地后端，你就能和自己的机器人交谈了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89cabb2803c27b4e",
      "translationZh": "方案 2：基于 Transformers 的本地 LLM（CUDA / CPU / MPS）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c75be6862bb0d448",
      "translationZh": "思路相同，但使用原生 transformers。如果你使用的是 CUDA 机器或 Linux，或者希望自由切换模型，而不必为 MLX 重新转换权重，就使用这个方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08e2bef9f5bca8d6",
      "translationZh": "提示。Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507 也是 LLM 的一个不错选择，因为它能在单张消费级 GPU 上实现良好的速度与质量平衡。你可以通过 --model_name 指定后端支持的任何 HF 模型，例如更大的 Gemma、Qwen 或 Mistral 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f2678f4b9a4d982",
      "translationZh": "在笔记本电脑上运行引擎，在机器人上运行应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1a3151d95047f64",
      "translationZh": "如果你在笔记本电脑上运行语音引擎，并在 Reachy Mini Wireless 上运行对话应用，唯一需要更改的就是 URL。请确保引擎绑定到局域网地址（而不只是 127.0.0.1），并在机器人的 UI 中选择 IP 时，使用笔记本电脑的 IP。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5eb5f703ad65ac3d",
      "translationZh": "如果你不知道自己的 IP，可以通过以下方法查找：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfea3b9d68458f7b",
      "translationZh": "在当前使用的网络适配器下查找“IPv4 Address”（IPv4 地址）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd5d104e9705cb46",
      "translationZh": "你要找的是 192.168.x.x 或 10.x.x.x 这样的地址。如果看到的是 169.254.x.x，说明你实际上并未连接到网络。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "316e3d3ddec5d500",
      "translationZh": "总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f965a95729ab01bc",
      "translationZh": "现在，你已经拥有一个完全在本地运行的语音交互闭环：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "923c5c8ce2e4f303",
      "translationZh": "机器人用 Silero 聆听，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64d26b61733c182d",
      "translationZh": "用 Parakeet-TDT 0.6B v3 转写，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60b59c93073e95c7",
      "translationZh": "用你选定的任意 LLM 思考，无论是本地 MLX、本地 Transformers、旁边一台机器上的 vLLM 或 llama.cpp 服务器，还是托管的 Responses API 端点，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96fa6da240ddfc35",
      "translationZh": "再用 Qwen3-TTS 回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8df6c3ef740e1d71",
      "translationZh": "给 huggingface/speech-to-speech 和 pollen-robotics/reachy_mini_conversation_app 点个 Star，并到讨论区告诉我们，你最终在机器人上运行了哪套开源级联系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
